OpenEdge example problems

Each sub-directory contains a test case you can run with OpenEdge.
Each problem has an input script (in.*) and most include analysis
or plotting scripts (Python). Some directories contain a README.md
with additional details.

test_boris_tokamak = Boris pusher with grid-interpolated tokamak B-field
test_collide = collisional thermalization with Nanbu scattering
test_cpc_gitr = CPC GITR benchmark for impurity transport with PMI
test_droplet = droplet emission, transport, and surface-interaction workflows
test_droplet_charging = OML (orbital motion limited) droplet charging with Boris E/B
test_droplet_drag = drag-model comparison for droplet cases (Epstein, Stokes, etc.)
test_droplet_viscous_3d = 3D viscous drag + gravity droplet transport
test_droplet_viscous_axi = axisymmetric viscous + gravity droplet cases
test_efield_polarization = polarization-drift validation for Boris pusher (particle and grid fields)
test_evaporation = evaporation validation and coupled drag+evaporation cases
test_gca = hybrid Boris/GCA pusher with equilibrium-based magnetic geometry
test_gravity_3d = 3D gravity-driven droplet transport
test_ionization_recombination = ionization and recombination with ADAS rates
test_sheath = sheath electric field with Boris pusher and IEAD diagnostics
test_solps_coupling = OpenEdge-to-SOLPS coupling utilities and validation assets
test_west_axi = WEST tokamak axisymmetric setup with plasma/material inputs

To run a test case:

cd test_efield_polarization
mpirun -np 4 /path/to/spa_mpi -in in.input.grid
